<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian trade union leader sacked.</title>
<headline>Tunisian trade union leader sacked.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian trade union leader Abdelmajid Sahraoui has been dismissed from his post as deputy secretary general of the Union Generale Tunisienne du Travail (UGTT), the organisation said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade union sources said that Sahraoui was accused of having strongly attacked the UGTT's Secretary General Ismail Sahbani but that Sahraoui denied the charge at a hearing of the discipline committee.</p>
<p>Sahraoui is banned from any union's activity, the statement said.</p>
</text>
